                {
                  "text": "stepped back from"
                },
                {
                  "text": "broke away from"
                },
                {
                  "text": "held on to"
                }
              ],
              "answer": "A",
              "collapsed": false
            },
            {
              "text": "It has been the tradition in China that elderly people live in a familiar environment, preferably __________ their children.",
              "options": [
                {
                  "text": "in the company of"
                },
                {
                  "text": "in place of"
                },
                {
                  "text": "in charge of"
                },
                {
                  "text": "in memory of"
                }
              ],
              "answer": "A",
              "collapsed": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Chinese isn’t a subject that can be __________ in a month, and you can’t accomplish your goal of mastering the language unless you work at it for years.",
